**Required ACL:** `search` Use this method to debug the relevance of a specific record. This method accepts a condition and returns the first matching object along with its position information in the result set. The `findObject` method uses search internally so it can also retrieve the position for a given query. To retrieve an object, use the more efficient [`getObjects`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/libraries/sdk/v1/methods/get-objects) method instead.
