Server-side rendered search experiences should be able to generate HTML based on the current URL. You can use the [`history`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/history-router/js) router to synchronize [`InstantSearch`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/react) with the browser URL.
