## See this widget in action
Preview this widget and its behavior.
##  About this widget
The `toggleRefinement` widget provides an on/off filtering feature based on an attribute value.
###  Requirements
Ensure that the attribute provided is already declared as an [attribute for faceting](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/managing-results/refine-results/faceting/how-to/declaring-attributes-for-faceting).
##  Examples
JavaScript

```
toggleRefinement({
  container: "#toggle-refinement",
  attribute: "free_shipping",
  templates: {
    labelText({ count }, { html }) {
      return html`Free shipping (${count.toLocaleString()})`;
    },
  },
});

```

