/>

```

##  Identify users
If you use Segment’s `analytics.identify()` function to identify users, use the same identifier for Algolia by passing it as the [`userToken`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/api-parameters/userToken) parameter with your search. For example, if you want to use [Personalization](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/personalization/classic-personalization/personalizing-results#turn-on-personalization-in-production):
