string
required
Query Suggestions index name. Name of the Query Suggestions index (case-sensitive).
Example:
`"ALGOLIA_INDEX_NAME"`
#### Body
application/json
Query Suggestions configuration.
sourceIndices
object[]
required
Algolia indices from which to get the popular searches for query suggestions.
