#### Path Parameters
userToken
string
required
Unique identifier representing a user for which to fetch the personalization profile. Unique pseudonymous or anonymous user identifier.
This helps with analytics and click and conversion events. For more information, see [user token](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/sending-events/concepts/usertoken).
