This example builds on the [`<Autocomplete>`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/building-search-ui/ui-and-ux-patterns/autocomplete/react) widget guide. It creates a federated autocomplete experience with recent searches and Query Suggestions on the left, and product previews on the right.
