##  Customize more than the empty state
The `emptyComponent` only replaces the initial empty state. To customize the surrounding chat layout (header, message list, prompt input), use the [`layoutComponent`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/chat/react) prop instead. Use `ChatInlineLayout` for an inline (non-overlay) layout, or `ChatOverlayLayout` for the default floating overlay, and reuse `headerComponent`, `messagesComponent`, and `promptComponent` to keep the built-in behavior.
