Build and run the app. You might see the centered text with the hits count below the search box. If you type into the search box, the displayed value remains unchanged. This happens because the `_searchTextController` and `_productsSearcher` aren’t connected.To fix it, override the `initState` method of the `_MyHomePageState` class and add a listener to the `_searchTextController` that propagates the input text to the `_productsSearcher`.
Dart

```
void initState() {
  super.initState();
  _searchTextController.addListener(
    () => _productsSearcher.query(_searchTextController.text),
  );


```

