Facet display
Build and run the app. The app bar now displays the filters button which shows the list of facet values (individual brands) for the brand attribute.A selection of these values doesn’t affect the search results. To fix it, connect `FilterState` to `HitsState` in the `initState` method, so that each change of `FilterState` triggers a new search request. Also, each filter state change might refresh the `_pagingController` to remove the obsolete loaded pages. Add the corresponding listener to the `_filterState.filters` stream.
