rootPath
string
The path to use if the first level is not the root level.Make sure to also include the root path in your [UI state](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/ui-state/js), for example, by setting [`initialUiState`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/js#param-initial-ui-state) or calling [`setUiState()`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/js#param-set-ui-state).
