| --- | --- | --- |  
| `FrequentlyBoughtTogether`  | [`FrequentlyBoughtTogether`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/frequently-bought-together/react)  | [Prop changes](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/algolia-recommend/upgrade/recommend-react#changes-for-frequentlyboughttogether)  |  
| `RelatedProducts`  | [`RelatedProducts`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/related-products/react)  | [Prop changes](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/algolia-recommend/upgrade/recommend-react#changes-for-relatedproducts)  |  
| `TrendingItems`  | [`TrendingItems`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/trending-items/react)  | [Prop changes](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/algolia-recommend/upgrade/recommend-react#changes-for-trendingitems)  |  
| `TrendingFacets`  | [`TrendingFacets`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/trending-facets/react)  | [Prop changes](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/algolia-recommend/upgrade/recommend-react#changes-for-trendingfacets)  |  
