###  Changes for `RelatedProducts`
####  Move `recommendClient` and `indexName` to `InstantSearch`
The [`RelatedProducts`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/related-products/react) component no longer needs `recommendClient` and `indexName` props. Instead, pass a `searchChlient` and the `ìndexName` to [`<InstantSearch>`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/react).
