showMoreButtonLabel
string
The static accessible name (`aria-label`) for the **Show more** and **Show less** toggle buttons. This option is only used when [`showMore`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/refinement-list/js#param-show-more) is `true`. Use a label that works for both expanded and collapsed states because this value doesn’t change as the button expands or collapses.
