  // ...
  autofocus: true,
});

```

ignoreCompositionEvents
boolean
default:false
since: v4.64.2
Whether to update the search state in the middle of a composition session. This is useful when users need to search using non-latin characters.
JavaScript

```
searchBox({
  // ...
  ignoreCompositionEvents: true,
});

```

searchAsYouType
boolean
default:true
If `false`, triggers the search only on submit.
JavaScript

```
searchBox({
  // ...
  searchAsYouType: false,
});

```

showReset
boolean
default:true
Whether to show the reset button.
JavaScript

```
searchBox({
  // ...
  showReset: false,
});

```

showSubmit
boolean
default:true
Whether to show the submit button.
JavaScript

```
