**Required ACL:** `addObject`, `deleteIndex`, `editSettings` You can make the call synchronous by providing the `watch` parameter, for asynchronous calls, you can use the observability endpoints or the debugger dashboard to see the status of your task. If you want to transform your data before indexing, this is the recommended way of ingesting your records. This method is similar to `push`, but requires a `taskID` instead of a `indexName`, which is useful when many `destinations` target the same `indexName`.
