##  About this Hook
The `useRatingMenu` Hook isn’t part of React InstantSearch. You can make a custom version with [`useConnector`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/connector/react) and [`connectRatingMenu`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/rating-menu/js). This Hook lets users refine search results by clicking on stars (based on the selected attribute).
