##  Regulatory requirements
In most regions (including the US, EU, and Canada), sponsored products must have a visual badge (such as “Sponsored”) on each injected product. For that reason, add a `sponsored: true` attribute to each sponsored product result. Under regulations like the [EU Platform to Business](https://www.ccpc.ie/business/help-for-business/guidelines-for-business/platform-to-business-regulations/), you may also need to disclose how paid placements influence your search ranking.
