import { autocomplete, getAlgoliaResults } from "@algolia/autocomplete-js";

```

Next, use `getSources` and `getAlgoliaResults` to get matching products from the Algolia index `instant_search`. This example uses custom rendering with [Preact](https://preactjs.com/) components.
