##  Hook
Use the `useDynamicWidgets` Hook to build a custom dynamic widgets UI. The Hook must run inside [`<InstantSearch>`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/react). React InstantSearch lets you create your own UI for the `<DynamicWidgets>` widget with `useDynamicWidgets`. Hooks provide APIs to access the widget state and interact with InstantSearch.
###  Usage
First, create your React component:
JavaScript

```
import { useDynamicWidgets } from "react-instantsearch";

function CustomDynamicWidgets(props) {
  const { attributesToRender } = useDynamicWidgets(props);

  return <>{/* Your JSX */}</>;


```

Then, render the widget:
