You can either delete the entire or only its :
  * [Delete everything](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/sending-and-managing-data/manage-indices-and-apps/manage-indices/how-to/delete-indices#delete-indices): removes the index, including records, rules, settings, and synonyms.
