##  About this widget
The `poweredBy` widget is used to display an Algolia logo and to redirect to Algolia’s homepage. [Algolia requires](https://www.algolia.com/policies/free-services-terms) that you use this widget if you’re on a community plan (open source, not-for-profit, or [DocSearch](https://docsearch.algolia.com)).
