##  Index configuration and API keys
When performing actions that have global impact on all clusters, such as using [`addApiKey`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/libraries/sdk/v1/methods/add-api-key) or [`setSettings`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/libraries/sdk/v1/methods/set-settings), you don’t need to provide the `X-Algolia-User-ID` header.
