Signature

```
dynamicWidgets({
  container: string | HTMLElement,
  widgets: function[],
  // Optional parameters
  transformItems?: function,
  fallbackWidget?: function,
  facets?: ['*']|[],
  maxValuesPerFacet?: number,
});

```

##  Import
Package manager
CDN

```
import { dynamicWidgets } from "instantsearch.js/es/widgets";

```


```
const { dynamicWidgets } = instantsearch.widgets;
// Use instantsearch.widgets.dynamicWidgets()

```

## See this widget in action
Preview this widget and its behavior.
##  About this widget
###  Requirements
Declare each facet attribute in [`attributesForFaceting`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/api-parameters/attributesForFaceting). Configure the facet order in the [Algolia dashboard](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/managing-results/refine-results/faceting/how-to/declaring-attributes-for-faceting-with-dashboard) or with [`renderingContent.facetOrdering`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/api-parameters/renderingContent#param-facet-ordering). By default, `dynamicWidgets` requests all facets with `facets: ["*"]` and requests up to 20 values per facet. These defaults help avoid a second request after the matching widgets mount. Override these defaults with [`facets`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/dynamic-widgets/js#param-facets) and [`maxValuesPerFacet`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/dynamic-widgets/js#param-max-values-per-facet).
`dynamicWidgets` requires InstantSearch.js 4.72.0 or later.
##  Examples
Default
Request customization

```
dynamicWidgets({
  container: "#dynamic-widgets",
  widgets: [
    (container) => refinementList({ container, attribute: "brand" }),
    (container) =>
      hierarchicalMenu({
        container,
        attributes: [
          "hierarchicalCategories.lvl0",
          "hierarchicalCategories.lvl1",
        ],
      }),
  ],
  fallbackWidget: ({ container, attribute }) =>
    panel({ templates: { header: attribute } })(menu)({ container, attribute }),
});

```


```
dynamicWidgets({
  container: "#dynamic-widgets",
  widgets: [
    (container) => refinementList({ container, attribute: "brand" }),
    (container) =>
      hierarchicalMenu({
        container,
        attributes: [
          "hierarchicalCategories.lvl0",
          "hierarchicalCategories.lvl1",
        ],
      }),
  ],
  fallbackWidget: ({ container, attribute }) =>
    panel({ templates: { header: attribute } })(menu)({ container, attribute }),
  // Send a second request after the widgets mount.
  facets: [],
  // Set this to at least the number of pinned values.
  maxValuesPerFacet: 100,
});

```

