## See this widget in action
Preview this widget and its behavior.
##  About this widget
The `pagination` widget displays a pagination system which lets users change the current page of search results.
Pagination is limited to 1,000 hits per page. For more information, see [Pagination limitations](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/building-search-ui/ui-and-ux-patterns/pagination/js#pagination-limitations).
##  Examples
