```
import { RelatedProducts } from "react-instantsearch";

```

##  About this widget
Use the `<RelatedProducts>` widget to display a list of related products and related content. See also: [Set up Algolia Recommend](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/algolia-recommend/how-to/set-up)
You can also create your own UI with [`useRelatedProducts`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/related-products/react#hook).
