This guide starts with a new React InstantSearch application, but you can adapt it to integrate Autocomplete into your existing implementation.
##  Create a search page with React InstantSearch
First, set up a starter template for the InstantSearch implementation with the `create-instantsearch-app` command-line utility.
Command line

```
npx create-instantsearch-app@latest react-instantsearch \
  --template "React InstantSearch" \
  --app-id "latency" \
  --api-key "6be0576ff61c053d5f9a3225e2a90f76" \
  --index-name instant_search \
  --attributes-to-display name,description \
  --attributes-for-faceting categories

```

