**A key feature to Autocomplete is to pre-configure your InstantSearch page**. The Query Suggestions plugin supports categories that you can use to refine both the query and the category in a single interaction This pattern brings users to the right category without interacting with the [`hierarchicalMenu`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/hierarchical-menu/js) widget, only with the autocomplete.
