[Four components](https://github.com/algolia/autocomplete/tree/next/packages/autocomplete-js/src/components) are registered by default:
  * [`Highlight`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/ui-libraries/autocomplete/api-reference/autocomplete-js/autocomplete#highlight) to highlight matches in Algolia results.
  * [`Snippet`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/ui-libraries/autocomplete/api-reference/autocomplete-js/autocomplete#snippet) to snippet matches in Algolia results.
  * [`ReverseHighlight`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/ui-libraries/autocomplete/api-reference/autocomplete-js/autocomplete#reversehighlight) to reverse highlight matches in Algolia results.
  * [`ReverseSnippet`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/ui-libraries/autocomplete/api-reference/autocomplete-js/autocomplete#reversesnippet) to reverse highlight and snippet matches in Algolia results.


