##  About this Hook
A React Hook that lets you access the InstantSearch API and interact with its state. This is useful to access and update the UI state, access the search results, refresh the search, or use middleware. Hooks must be used inside the [`<InstantSearch>`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/react) component.
