####  Set the widget search parameters
When initializing InstantSearch state from a URL, you need to convert the URL into [search parameters](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/search-api-parameters) to trigger the first search. To define how to derive search parameters from the UI state, use the `getWidgetSearchParameters` method. This method lets you modify the existing search parameters based on the widget’s configuration and the current UI state.
