routing.stateMapping
object
Transforms the [`uiState`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/ui-state/js) into the object saved by the router. The default value is provided by [`simple`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/simple-state-mapping/js).
