future.preserveSharedStateOnUnmount
boolean
default:false
since: v4.58.0
Changes the way `dispose` is used in the InstantSearch lifecycle.If `false` (the default), each widget unmounting will also remove its state, even if multiple widgets read that UI state.If `true`, each widget unmounting will only remove its state if it’s the last of its type. This allows you to dynamically add and remove widgets without losing their state.
