##  Hook
React InstantSearch let you create your own UI for the `<ToggleRefinement>` widget with `useToggleRefinement`. Hooks provide APIs to access the widget state and interact with InstantSearch. The `useToggleRefinement` Hook accepts [parameters](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/toggle-refinement/react#parameters) and returns [APIs](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/toggle-refinement/react#hook). It must be used inside the [`<InstantSearch>`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/widgets/instantsearch/react) component.
