If you need to show more than 1,000 hits, you can set a different limit using the [`paginationLimitedTo`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/api-parameters/paginationLimitedTo) parameter. The higher you set this limit, the slower your search performance can become.
Increasing the limit doesn’t mean you can go until the end of the hits, but just that Algolia will go as far as possible in the to retrieve results in a reasonable time.
