Batching index updates reduces latency and increases data integrity.
  * Actions are applied in the order they’re specified.
  * Actions are equivalent to the individual API requests of the same name.

This operation is subject to [indexing rate limits](https://support.algolia.com/hc/articles/4406975251089-Is-there-a-rate-limit-for-indexing-on-Algolia). **Required ACL:** `addObject`
