a href={item.url}>
components.Highlight
                    hit={item}
                    attribute="name"
                    tagName="em"

                </a>
              </div>

          },
        },
      },
    ];
  },
});

```

##  Render a no-results state
If there are no results, you might want to display a message to inform users or let them know what to do next. Do this with the [`noResults`](https://www.algolia.com/doc/ui-libraries/autocomplete/core-concepts/templates#param-templates-no-results) template.
JavaScript

```
autocomplete({
  // ...
  getSources({ query }) {
    return [

        // ...
        templates: {
          // ...
          noResults() {
            return "No results.";
          },
        },
      },
    ];
  },
});

```

