###  Inject an external source Smart Group
Inject an external source Smart Group into one of your feeds to surface sponsored items selected at query time by your retail-media platform or bidding system. The object IDs are passed in the request body when querying the composition (see [External source groups](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/compositions/smart-groups/external-source-groups)).
JSON

```

  "behavior": {
    "multifeed": {
      "feeds": {
        "football-brands": {
          "injection": {
            "main": {
              "source": {
                "search": {
                  "index": "product-brands",
                  "params": {
                    "filters": "category:football"




            "injectedItems": [

                "key": "sponsored-football",
                "source": {
                  "external": {
                    "index": "products",
                    "ordering": "userDefined"


                "position": 0,
                "length": 3




      },
      "feedsOrder": [
        "football-brands"





```

