string
Algolia name.
query
string
Current search query.
params
object
[Search API parameters](https://www.algolia.com/doc/api-reference/search-api-parameters), such as `filters`, `hitsPerPage`, or `analyticsTags`.
context
object
Context information.
Show child attributes
pluginName
string
Name of the plugin triggering the query, such as `products`, `collections`, `articles`, or `pages`.
